sentences.text:
The present applications are filed seeking Pre-arrest bail in FIR no. 319/2023, dated 15.04.2023,
for offences under Sections 354/354-A/354-B/498A/406/376/34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860,
registered at Police Station Sultanpuri.

The applicants will not leave the country without the permission of the learned Trial Court ; c. The applicants shall not contact the complainant / witnesses or tamper with the evidence in any manner;
Sunil Sehwag vs The State (Govt. Of Nct Of Delhi) on 15 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/114700880/
4 d.

